ANCE REPORTS FISCAL 2023 THIRD QUARTER RESULTS.'}{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2023-06-27 08:05:00', 'title': 'GENPACT AND WALMART EXTEND PARTNERSHIP IN NORTH AMERICA', 'text': 'CONTRACT EXTENSION BUILDS ON COLLABORATIVE RELATIONSHIP TO LAYER DIGITAL TECHNOLOGY INTO FINANCE OPERATIONS NEW YORK , JUNE 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GENPACT\xa0(NYSE: G), A GLOBAL PROFESSIONAL SERVICES FIRM FOCUSED ON DELIVERING OUTCOMES THAT TRANSFORM BUSINESSES, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS EXTENDED ITS PARTNERSHIP WITH WALMART\xa0(NYSE: WMT) TO CONTINUE TO SUPPORT ITS NORTH AMERICAN FINANCE AND ACCOUNTING OPERATIONS. THE CURRENT EXTENSION BUILDS ON THE RELATIONSHIP THAT THE TWO COMPANIES BEGAN IN 2018 IN NORTH AMERICA WHICH HAS SINCE EXPANDED TO OTHER MARKETS IN LATIN AMERICA AND SOUTH AFRICA.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2023-06-27 12:00:00', 'title': 'AEQUUM CAPITAL EXPANDS EXISTING WAREHOUSE LINE WITH THE ADDITION OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY', 'text': "CHICAGO , JUNE 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AEQUUM CAPITAL RECENTLY EXPANDED ITS REVOLVING LINE OF CREDIT LED BY TEXAS CAPITAL BANK TO\xa0$60 MILLION\xa0BY ADDING WELLS FARGO & COMPANY TO THE BANK LENDING GROUP.\xa0 THIS NEW FINANCING WILL FURTHER AUGMENT AEQUUM'S SIGNIFICANT EQUITY BASE LED BY CASTLELAKE, LP."}{'symbol': 'ZBRA', 'date': '2023-06-27 11:46:00', 'title': 'ZEBRA TECHNOLOGIES LAUNCHES TC22/TC27 MOBILE COMPUTER FOR ENTERPRISE-GRADE MANAGEABILITY AND PRODUCTIVITY', 'text': 'LINCOLNSHIRE, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ZEBRA TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION (NASDAQ: ZBRA), A LEADING DIGITAL SOLUTION PROVIDER ENABLING BUSINESSES TO INTELLIGENTLY CONNECT DATA, ASSETS, AND PEOPLE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE TC22/TC27 – A VALUABLE MOBILE COMPUTER FOR ORGANIZATIONS THAT WERE PREVIOUSLY CONSTRAINED TO USE CONSUMER OR LOWER QUALITY DEVICES LACKING THE FEATURES THEY NEED TO MAXIMIZE EFFICIENCY AND PRODUCTIVITY. THIS POWERFUL, FEATURE-RICH DEVICE IS IDEAL FOR BUSINESSES INCLUDING SM.'}